.\n' No Admin UI or learner learning/assessment/SRS runtime exists; deployment/live DB unverified.\nleft to right direction\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 th\u00e0nh ph\u1ea7n theo m\u00e3 ngu\u1ed3n hi\u1ec7n c\u00f3\n\npackage \&quot;\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng web h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;Khung giao di\u1ec7n\&quot; as UI\n  component \&quot;\u0110a ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t / Anh\&quot; as I18n\n  component \&quot;\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp, \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd, \u0111\u0103ng xu\u1ea5t\&quot; as AuthActions\n  component \&quot;Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd phi\u00ean m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7\&quot; as Session\n}\npackage \&quot;Kh\u00f4ng gian d\u1eef li\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb\&quot; {\n  artifact \&quot;M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Prisma\&quot; as Prisma\n  artifact \&quot;SQL migration\&quot; as SQL\n  artifact \&quot;Script seed v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m tra\&quot; as Scripts\n}\npackage \&quot;Khai b\u00e1o t\u00edch h\u1ee3p Supabase\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c\&quot; as Auth\n  database \&quot;K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n  storage \&quot;Khai b\u00e1o kho \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u\&quot; as Storage\n}\nUI --&gt; AuthActions : Thao t\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\nUI --&gt; I18n : N\u1ed9i dung giao di\u1ec7n\nAuthActions --&gt; Session : M\u00e1y kh\u00e1ch ph\u00eda m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7\nSession ..&gt; Auth : T\u00edch h\u1ee3p x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c\nPrisma ..&gt; DB : C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh ngu\u1ed3n d\u1eef li\u1ec7u\nScripts --&gt; Prisma : S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Prisma Client\nSQL ..&gt; DB : \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n\nSQL ..&gt; Storage : \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a kho v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
