        <UserObject id="2" label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: SYS-04\n' classification: TARGET\n' Authority: ADR-027 as scoped by ADR-030\u2013036; logical modules run in each application.\n' Nested modules are in-process components, not separately deployed network services.\n' Placement recommends starting point; level-up controls progression; no Reassessment/AI runtime.\n' Lesson completion independent of performance; ADR-036 retry/performance and history apply.\n' SRS scheduling/idempotency is trusted; global streak records only qualifying activity.\n' Admin cannot author content or alter learner evidence; support limited and audited.\n' Physical role/RLS/version/result/SRS/audit realization remains deferred.\nleft to right direction\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac th\u00e0nh ph\u1ea7n logic c\u1ee7a Lingora\n\npackage \&quot;\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng web h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;Giao di\u1ec7n h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\&quot; as LearnerUI\n  package \&quot;X\u1eed l\u00fd ph\u00eda m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7\&quot; as LearnerBackend {\n    component \&quot;X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m tra quy\u1ec1n\&quot; as LearnerGuard\n    component \&quot;B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9\&quot; as Learning\n    component \&quot;X\u1ebfp l\u1edbp v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m tra l\u00ean c\u1ea5p\&quot; as Assessment\n    component \&quot;\u00d4n t\u1eadp v\u00e0 chu\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y h\u1ecdc\&quot; as Review\n  }\n}\npackage \&quot;\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb v\u00e0 bi\u00ean so\u1ea1n\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;Giao di\u1ec7n gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb\&quot; as StaffUI\n  package \&quot;X\u1eed l\u00fd ph\u00eda m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7\&quot; as StaffBackend {\n    component \&quot;X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m tra quy\u1ec1n\&quot; as StaffGuard\n    component \&quot;Ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng, bi\u00ean so\u1ea1n v\u00e0 xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n\&quot; as Governance\n    component \&quot;Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\&quot; as Accounts\n    component \&quot;B\u00e1o c\u00e1o v\u00e0 nh\u1eadt k\u00fd\&quot; as Reports\n  }\n}\npackage \&quot;D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Supabase\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c\&quot; as Auth\n  database \&quot;D\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t quy\u1ec1n\&quot; as DB\n  storage \&quot;T\u00e0i li\u1ec7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t quy\u1ec1n\&quot; as Media\n}\nLearnerUI --&gt; LearnerGuard\nLearnerGuard --&gt; Learning\nLearnerGuard --&gt; Assessment\nLearnerGuard --&gt; Review\nLearnerGuard --&gt; Auth\nStaffUI --&gt; StaffGuard\nStaffGuard --&gt; Governance\nStaffGuard --&gt; Accounts\nStaffGuard --&gt; Reports\nStaffGuard --&gt; Auth\nLearning --&gt; DB : B\u00e0i h\u1ecdc v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed\nAssessment --&gt; DB : Ch\u1ea5m \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3\nReview --&gt; DB : Th\u1ebb, l\u1ecbch \u00f4n v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng\nGovernance --&gt; DB : Ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n\nAccounts --&gt; DB : T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 t\u00f3m t\u1eaft h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3\nReports --&gt; DB : B\u00e1o c\u00e1o v\u00e0 nh\u1eadt k\u00fd\nLearning --&gt; Media : T\u00e0i li\u1ec7u \u0111\u00e3 xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n\nGovernance --&gt; Media : T\u00e0i li\u1ec7u theo ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
