        <UserObject id="2" label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: ACT-08\n' classification: TARGET\n' authority: ADR-034/035/036; UC-09/10/11/12/14\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u2013 So\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o, duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n n\u1ed9i dung\n|Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\u00ean|\nstart\n:X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh y\u00eau c\u1ea7u n\u1ed9i dung;\nif (C\u00f3 g\u00f3i \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1?) then (C\u00f3)\n  :X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1eb7c t\u1ea3 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 bao ph\u1ee7 b\u00e0i \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1;\nelse (Kh\u00f4ng)\nendif\n:Giao g\u00f3i n\u1ed9i dung cho m\u1ed9t gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean;\n|H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng|\n:Ghi ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 tr\u00e1ch v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed giao vi\u1ec7c;\nrepeat\n  |Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean|\n  :M\u1edf b\u1ea3n nh\u00e1p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao;\n  :So\u1ea1n b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc, b\u00e0i t\u1eadp v\u00e0 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1;\n  :Xem th\u1eed n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n;\n  |H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng|\n  :Ki\u1ec3m tra quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh;\n  :Ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111\u1ed9 bao ph\u1ee7, c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh,\\nch\u1ea5m \u0111i\u1ec3m, ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7;\n  :Ki\u1ec3m tra kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng c\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 l\u1ed9 \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n;\n  while (Ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n g\u1eedi duy\u1ec7t?) is (C\u00f3)\n    :Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u1ed7i c\u1ea7n s\u1eeda;\n    |Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean|\n    :S\u1eeda b\u1ea3n nh\u00e1p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao;\n    |H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng|\n    :Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i;\n  endwhile (Kh\u00f4ng)\n  |Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean|\n  :G\u1eedi b\u1ea3n so\u1ea1n th\u1ea3o;\n  |H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng|\n  :Chuy\u1ec3n sang ch\u1edd duy\u1ec7t, gi\u1eef l\u1ecbch s\u1eed;\n  |Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\u00ean|\n  :Xem n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i;\n  if (Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda?) then (C\u00f3)\n    :Ghi ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i;\n    |H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng|\n    :Chuy\u1ec3n sang c\u1ea7n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda;\n  else (Kh\u00f4ng)\n  endif\nrepeat while (C\u1ea7n ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda?) is (C\u00f3)\n-&gt;Kh\u00f4ng;\n|Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\u00ean|\n:Ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t;\n:Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n;\n|H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng|\n:Ki\u1ec3m tra quy\u1ec1n, b\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7;\nif (Xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng?) then (C\u00f3)\n  :Xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn;\n  :Chuy\u1ec3n b\u1ea3n b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc \u0111ang d\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nguy\u00ean t\u1eed;\n  if (C\u00f3 g\u00f3i \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1?) then (C\u00f3)\n    :Xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn;\n    :L\u01b0\u1ee3t \u0111ang l\u00e0m gi\u1eef phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eafn;\n  else (Kh\u00f4ng)\n  endif\n  :Gi\u1eef t\u00e1c gi\u1ea3, l\u1ecbch s\u1eed v\u00e0 b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ee9ng h\u1ecdc;\nelse (Kh\u00f4ng)\n  :Gi\u1eef b\u1ea3n \u0111ang xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n;\n  :B\u00e1o l\u1ed7i xu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n;\nendif\n:Ghi nh\u1eadt k\u00fd h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3;\nstop\n' Blueprint covers language/framework/level or transition/purpose, curriculum/topic/skill/knowledge coverage,\n' item requirements/distribution and necessary configuration. Admin does not author actual items.\n' Assigned Teacher edits Draft/Changes Requested only, with minimal optimistic version check.\n' Different assessment items/variants may test the same concept; no generic QuestionBank/workflow.\n' Lesson/revision is publication unit; no requirement for atomic entire Unit or physical transaction design.\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
