        <UserObject id="2" label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: SEQ-03\n' classification: TARGET\n' authority: ADR-034, ADR-035, ADR-036; UC-09, UC-10, UC-11\n' One assignment covers one lesson/content package and related exercise/assessment items.\n' Exactly one responsible Teacher; reassignment retains attribution and history.\n' Admin defines requirements/blueprint, never authors items or self-approves.\n' Minimal optimistic version check; no collaboration/workflow subsystem implied.\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ef1 \u2013 Ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng, so\u1ea1n v\u00e0 n\u1ed9p n\u1ed9i dung\nautonumber\nactor \&quot;Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\u00ean\&quot; as Admin\nactor \&quot;Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean\&quot; as Teacher\nboundary \&quot;\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng web\&quot; as Web\ncontrol \&quot;Backend\&quot; as Server\ndatabase \&quot;C\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u\&quot; as DB\n\nAdmin -&gt; Web : L\u1eadp y\u00eau c\u1ea7u; ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng m\u1ed9t Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean\nWeb -&gt; Server : G\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb\nServer -&gt; DB : L\u01b0u \u0111\u1ec1 c\u01b0\u01a1ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 tr\u00e1ch v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed\nServer -&gt; DB : Ghi nh\u1eadt k\u00fd ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed5i ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng\nServer --&gt; Web : X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng\n\nTeacher -&gt; Web : M\u1edf n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao\nWeb -&gt; Server : Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh\nServer -&gt; DB : L\u1ea5y n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p xem\nDB --&gt; Server : N\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao\nServer --&gt; Web : Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i\nTeacher -&gt; Web : So\u1ea1n v\u00e0 l\u01b0u b\u1ea3n s\u1eeda\nWeb -&gt; Server : G\u1eedi b\u1ea3n s\u1eeda\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng, tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i v\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n\nalt Ngo\u00e0i ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng, kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eeda ho\u1eb7c xung \u0111\u1ed9t phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n\n  Server --&gt; Web : T\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i; gi\u1eef b\u1ea3n tr\u01b0\u1edbc\nelse B\u1ea3n Nh\u00e1p ho\u1eb7c Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7\n  Server -&gt; DB : L\u01b0u b\u1ea3n s\u1eeda v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed t\u00e1c gi\u1ea3\n  Server --&gt; Web : X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn l\u01b0u; cho ph\u00e9p xem tr\u01b0\u1edbc\nend\n\nTeacher -&gt; Web : N\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9p l\u1ea1i n\u1ed9i dung\nWeb -&gt; Server : Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u g\u1eedi th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111\u1ec1 c\u01b0\u01a1ng, c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi, \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n v\u00e0 h\u1ecdc li\u1ec7u\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp \u0111\u00e3 l\u1ed9 \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n\nalt Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ee7 quy\u1ec1n, xung \u0111\u1ed9t ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ea1t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u\n  Server --&gt; Web : T\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i n\u1ed9p; hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u1ed7i\nelse N\u1ed9i dung h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ee7 quy\u1ec1n\n  Server -&gt; DB : Chuy\u1ec3n sang Ch\u1edd th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh; gi\u1eef l\u1ecbch s\u1eed\n  Server -&gt; DB : Ghi nh\u1eadt k\u00fd n\u1ed9p n\u1ed9i dung\n  Server --&gt; Web : X\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eedi th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh\nend\nWeb --&gt; Teacher : Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
