        <UserObject id="2" label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: SEQ-07\n' classification: TARGET\n' authority: ADR-031, ADR-032, ADR-033, ADR-035, ADR-036; UC-02, UC-05\n' MVP purposes: Placement and Level-up only; no Reassessment.\n' AssessmentResult retains separate assessmentType/deliveryMode classifications.\n' Count/time/threshold/mapping are configuration, not platform invariants.\n' No per-item correctness during attempt, or keys/solutions after submission.\n' A deliberate new attempt is separate; same submission is idempotent.\n' Incomplete Placement preserves prior starting point; assessment does not qualify streak.\n' Passed Level-up evidence survives next-level content being locked/coming soon.\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ef1 \u2013 N\u1ed9p b\u00e0i ki\u1ec3m tra x\u1ebfp l\u1edbp ho\u1eb7c l\u00ean c\u1ea5p\nautonumber\nactor \&quot;H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\&quot; as Learner\nboundary \&quot;\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng web\&quot; as Web\ncontrol \&quot;Backend\&quot; as Server\ndatabase \&quot;C\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u\&quot; as DB\n\nLearner -&gt; Web : B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ki\u1ec3m tra x\u1ebfp l\u1edbp ho\u1eb7c l\u00ean c\u1ea5p\nWeb -&gt; Server : Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t ki\u1ec3m tra\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, ng\u1eef c\u1ea3nh v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh n\u1ebfu thi l\u00ean c\u1ea5p\nalt Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u\n  Server --&gt; Web : T\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u; gi\u1eef ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9\nelse \u0110\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n\n  Server -&gt; DB : L\u1ea5y phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n ki\u1ec3m tra b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn \u0111ang d\u00f9ng\n  DB --&gt; Server : C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi v\u00e0 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u ch\u1ea5m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7\n  Server -&gt; Server : G\u1eafn l\u01b0\u1ee3t ki\u1ec3m tra v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n\n  Server --&gt; Web : G\u1eedi c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi; gi\u1eef k\u00edn \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang/sai\n  Learner -&gt; Web : N\u1ed9p c\u00e2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng\n  Web -&gt; Server : G\u1eedi b\u00e0i l\u00e0m v\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t ki\u1ec3m tra\n  Server -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra ch\u1ee7 s\u1edf h\u1eefu, ng\u1eef c\u1ea3nh, phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 b\u00e0i l\u00e0m\n  Server -&gt; DB : \u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu l\u01b0\u1ee3t n\u1ed9p v\u00e0 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u00e3 ghi\n  DB --&gt; Server : K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu theo ch\u1ee7 s\u1edf h\u1eefu\n  alt B\u00e0i n\u1ed9p kh\u00f4ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7\n    Server --&gt; Web : Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ea1o k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t; gi\u1eef ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9\n  else N\u1ed9p l\u1ea1i c\u00f9ng l\u1ea7n n\u1ed9p h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 \u0111\u00e3 ghi nh\u1eadn\n    Server --&gt; Web : Tr\u1ea3 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p \u0111\u00e3 ghi; kh\u00f4ng ghi l\u1ea1i\n  else L\u1ea7n n\u1ed9p h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 m\u1edbi\n    Server -&gt; Server : Ch\u1ea5m theo phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eafn\n    alt Ki\u1ec3m tra x\u1ebfp l\u1edbp\n      Server -&gt; Server : T\u00ednh \u0111i\u1ec3m b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t theo c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh\n    else Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u00ean c\u1ea5p\n      Server -&gt; Server : X\u00e9t \u0111\u1ea1t theo c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh\n    end\n    alt Ghi nh\u1eadn th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng\n      Server -&gt; DB : L\u01b0u k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn theo ng\u1eef c\u1ea3nh v\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n\n      opt \u0110\u1ea1t \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n l\u00ean c\u1ea5p\n        Server -&gt; DB : Ghi k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 l\u00ean c\u1ea5p; gi\u1eef b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ee9ng\n      end\n      Server --&gt; Web : Ch\u1ec9 tr\u1ea3 \u0111i\u1ec3m t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p, k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t\n    else Ghi nh\u1eadn th\u1ea5t b\u1ea1i\n      Server --&gt; Web : Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ea1o k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t; gi\u1eef ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9\n    end\n  end\nend\nWeb --&gt; Learner : Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p ho\u1eb7c l\u1ed7i\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
