        <UserObject id="2" label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: SEQ-08\n' classification: TARGET\n' authority: ADR-030, ADR-031, ADR-033, ADR-035, ADR-036; UC-07, UC-08\n' One global User+Vocabulary card; PAUSED context does not disable SRS.\n' Policy B, two ratings only. Client schedule is never authoritative.\n' Same operation retry is idempotent; a deliberate new review is another operation.\n' Reinforcement has no second scheduling operation; no extra activity policy introduced.\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ef1 \u2013 Th\u00eam t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng v\u00e0 \u00f4n t\u1eadp ng\u1eaft qu\u00e3ng\nautonumber\nactor \&quot;H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\&quot; as Learner\nboundary \&quot;\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng web\&quot; as Web\ncontrol \&quot;Backend\&quot; as Server\ndatabase \&quot;C\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u\&quot; as DB\n\nopt Ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc ho\u1eb7c ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u00eam t\u1eeb t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn\n  alt Ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc\n    Server -&gt; Server : Ch\u1ecdn t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc\n  else H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean ch\u1ecdn th\u00eam t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn\n    Learner -&gt; Web : Th\u00eam t\u1eeb v\u00e0o \u00f4n t\u1eadp\n    Web -&gt; Server : Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u th\u00eam t\u1eeb t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn\n    Server -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng\n  end\n  Server -&gt; DB : T\u00ecm th\u1ebb c\u1ee7a H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean v\u00e0 t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng\n  DB --&gt; Server : Th\u1ebb \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 ho\u1eb7c ch\u01b0a c\u00f3\n  alt Th\u1ebb \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ed3n t\u1ea1i\n    Server -&gt; Server : D\u00f9ng l\u1ea1i th\u1ebb; gi\u1eef giai \u0111o\u1ea1n v\u00e0 ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ea1n\n  else Ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 th\u1ebb\n    Server -&gt; DB : T\u1ea1o th\u1ebb giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 1; \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ea1n sau 1 ng\u00e0y\n  end\nend\n\nLearner -&gt; Web : M\u1edf phi\u00ean \u00f4n t\u1eadp\nWeb -&gt; Server : Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u th\u1ebb \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ea1n\nServer -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n; cho ph\u00e9p c\u1ea3 ng\u1eef c\u1ea3nh t\u1ea1m d\u1eebng\nServer -&gt; DB : L\u1ea5y th\u1ebb \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\nDB --&gt; Server : Danh s\u00e1ch th\u1ebb\nServer --&gt; Web : Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u1ebb \u00f4n t\u1eadp\nloop M\u1ed7i th\u1ebb \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ea1n, ch\u01b0a g\u1ed3m l\u01b0\u1ee3t c\u1ee7ng c\u1ed1\n  Learner -&gt; Web : Ch\u1ecdn \u0110\u00e3 nh\u1edb ho\u1eb7c Ch\u01b0a nh\u1edb\n  Web -&gt; Server : G\u1eedi th\u1ebb, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 v\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t \u00f4n\n  Server -&gt; Server : Ki\u1ec3m tra t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, th\u1ebb v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1\n  Server -&gt; DB : Ki\u1ec3m tra l\u01b0\u1ee3t \u00f4n \u0111\u00e3 ghi nh\u1eadn\n  DB --&gt; Server : K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 tra c\u1ee9u l\u01b0\u1ee3t \u00f4n\n  alt G\u1eedi l\u1ea1i c\u00f9ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t \u00f4n \u0111\u00e3 ghi\n    Server --&gt; Web : Tr\u1ea3 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 c\u0169; kh\u00f4ng t\u00ednh l\u1ecbch l\u1ea7n n\u1eefa\n  else L\u01b0\u1ee3t \u00f4n h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 m\u1edbi\n    Server -&gt; DB : L\u1ea5y giai \u0111o\u1ea1n hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i\n    DB --&gt; Server : Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a th\u1ebb\n    alt Ch\u01b0a nh\u1edb\n      Server -&gt; Server : V\u1ec1 giai \u0111o\u1ea1n 1; \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ea1n sau 1 ng\u00e0y\n    else \u0110\u00e3 nh\u1edb\n      Server -&gt; Server : Ti\u1ebfn l\u1ecbch 1 \u2192 3 \u2192 7 \u2192 14 \u2192 30 ng\u00e0y\n      Server -&gt; Server : Sau giai \u0111o\u1ea1n cu\u1ed1i: gi\u1eef th\u1ebb, l\u1eb7p m\u1ed7i 30 ng\u00e0y\n    end\n    Server -&gt; DB : Ghi m\u1ed9t l\u01b0\u1ee3t \u00f4n v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch \u0111\u00e3 t\u00ednh\n    Server -&gt; DB : Ghi ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng cho chu\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y h\u1ecdc to\u00e0n t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\n    Server --&gt; Web : Tr\u1ea3 l\u1ecbch \u00f4n m\u1edbi\n    opt Ch\u01b0a nh\u1edb v\u00e0 ch\u01b0a th\u00eam l\u01b0\u1ee3t c\u1ee7ng c\u1ed1 trong phi\u00ean\n      Server --&gt; Web : \u0110\u01b0a th\u1ebb xu\u1ed1ng cu\u1ed1i phi\u00ean \u0111\u00fang m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n\n    end\n  end\nend\nopt C\u00f3 th\u1ebb c\u1ea7n c\u1ee7ng c\u1ed1 cu\u1ed1i phi\u00ean\n  loop M\u1ed7i th\u1ebb c\u1ea7n c\u1ee7ng c\u1ed1, t\u1ed1i \u0111a m\u1ed9t l\u01b0\u1ee3t\n    Server --&gt; Web : Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u1ea1i th\u1ebb\n    Learner -&gt; Web : 