        <UserObject id="2" label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: SEC-01\n' classification: TARGET\n' Authority: ADR-035/036. Logical DFD/trust boundary; no physical schema or deployed RLS claim.\n' auth.uid() trusted subject; server-controlled role/status; disabled denied from next request.\n' Client user ID/role/interval/due date not authoritative; appropriate RLS required by ADR-035.\n' Teacher edits assigned Draft/Changes Requested only; Admin cannot author or edit learning evidence.\n' Publish approved/readiness-validated immutable version; atomic replacement retains history.\n' Generic learner reads omit keys; assessments return aggregate only, practice has formative feedback.\n' Assessment attempts pin immutable version; same submission retry is idempotent.\n' SRS: User+Vocabulary; core auto-enroll/optional add; Policy B recurring final 30 days.\n' Client ratings remembered/forgotten; trusted scheduling/idempotency; reinforcement no reschedule.\n' Account support reads necessary identity/status/minimal context summary; actions audited.\n' Audit append-only, Admin reader; privileged events and sensitive denials; no secrets logged.\n' Datastore is a logical trust partition, not a final table or one prescribed physical database.\n' All learner/staff responses are filtered by trusted authorization; there is no client-store bypass.\nleft to right direction\nskinparam nodesep 38\nskinparam ranksep 55\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 lu\u1ed3ng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ranh gi\u1edbi tin c\u1eady\n\nrectangle \&quot;Tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t kh\u00f4ng tin c\u1eady\&quot; {\n  rectangle \&quot;H\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\&quot; as LearnerClient\n  rectangle \&quot;Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean / Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\u00ean\&quot; as StaffClient\n}\nrectangle \&quot;Ranh gi\u1edbi \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ph\u00eda m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7\&quot; {\n  rectangle \&quot;X\u00e1c th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n quy\u1ec1n\\nVai tr\u00f2, tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i tin c\u1eady\&quot; as Guard\n  rectangle \&quot;Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t n\u1ed9i dung\\nB\u1ea3n nh\u00e1p theo ph\u00e2n c\u00f4ng\\nXu\u1ea5t b\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 duy\u1ec7t\&quot; as Content\n  rectangle \&quot;Ch\u1ea5m \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7\\nGi\u1eef b\u00ed m\u1eadt \u0111\u00e1p \u00e1n\&quot; as Grading\n  rectangle \&quot;L\u1eadp l\u1ecbch \u00f4n t\u1eadp\\nL\u1ecbch tin c\u1eady, ch\u1ed1ng ghi tr\u00f9ng\&quot; as SRS\n  rectangle \&quot;H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\\nKh\u00f4ng s\u1eeda b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ee9ng h\u1ecdc t\u1eadp\&quot; as Support\n  rectangle \&quot;Ghi nh\u1eadt k\u00fd b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt\&quot; as Audit\n}\nrectangle \&quot;D\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c\&quot; as Auth\n  database \&quot;T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u h\u1ecdc t\u1eadp\\nN\u1ed9i dung theo quy\u1ec1n\\n\u0110\u00e1p \u00e1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7\&quot; as Data\n  database \&quot;Nh\u1eadt k\u00fd b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt\\nCh\u1ec9 ghi th\u00eam; Admin \u0111\u1ecdc\&quot; as AuditStore\n}\nLearnerClient --&gt; Guard : B\u00e0i l\u00e0m, nh\u1edb / qu\u00ean\nStaffClient --&gt; Guard : N\u1ed9i dung, l\u1ec7nh qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb\nGuard --&gt; LearnerClient : N\u1ed9i dung, ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p\nGuard --&gt; StaffClient : D\u1eef li\u1ec7u theo quy\u1ec1n\nGuard --&gt; Auth : X\u00e1c minh danh t\u00ednh\nData --&gt; Guard : Vai tr\u00f2, tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i\nGuard &lt;--&gt; Content : N\u1ed9i dung theo quy\u1ec1n\nGuard &lt;--&gt; Grading : B\u00e0i l\u00e0m / ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7\nGuard &lt;--&gt; SRS : Th\u1ebb, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 / l\u1ecbch\nGuard &lt;--&gt; Support : Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u / t\u00f3m t\u1eaft h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3\nGuard --&gt; Audit : S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m\nContent &lt;--&gt; Data : N\u1ed9i dung theo quy\u1ec1n\nGrading &lt;--&gt; Data : \u0110\u00e1p \u00e1n / k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3\nSRS &lt;--&gt; Data : Th\u1ebb, l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed\nSupport &lt;--&gt; Data : T\u00f3m t\u1eaft / tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n\nAudit --&gt; AuditStore : S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ee9a b\u00ed m\u1eadt\nAuditStore --&gt; Guard : \u0110\u1ecdc theo quy\u1ec1n Admin\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;editIcon=1;image=data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20xmlns%3Axlink%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F1999%2Fxlink%22%20version%3D%221.1%22%20data-diagram-type%3D%22DESCRIPTION%22%20style%3D%22width%3A1537px%3Bheight%3A757px%3Bbackground%3A%23FFFFFF%3B%22%20width%3D%221537px%22%20height%3D%22757px%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201537%20757%22%20zoomAndPan%3D%22magnify%22%20preserveAspectRatio%3D%22none%22%20contentStyleType%3D%22text%2Fcss%22%3E%3C%3Fplantuml%201.2026.8%3F%3E%3Cdefs%2F%3E%3Cg%20font-family%3D%22sans-serif%22%20lengthAdjust%3D%22spacing%22%3E%3Cg%20class%3D%22title%22%20data-source-line%3D%2220%22%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22594.668%22%20y%3D%2226.884%22%20fill%3D%22%23000%22%20font-size%3D%2218%22%20textLength%3D%22340.664%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%3ES%C6%A1%20%C4%91%E1%BB%93%20lu%E1%BB%93ng%20d%E1%BB%AF%20li%E1%BB%87u%20v%C3%A0%20ranh%20gi%E1%BB%9Bi%20tin%20c%E1%BA%ADy%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%21--cluster%20Tr%C3%ACnh%20duy%E1%BB%87t%20kh%C3%B4ng%20tin%20c%E1%BA%ADy--%3E%3Cg%20class%3D%22cluster%22%20data-qualified-name%3D%22Tr.nh%20duy.t%20kh.ng%20tin%20c.y%22%20id%3D%22ent0001%22%20data-source-line%3D%2222%22%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%227%22%20y%3D%22337.698%22%20width%3D%22202%22%20height%3D%22161%22%20fill%3D%22%23FFF%22%20style%3D%22stroke%3A%23000%3Bstroke-width%3A1%3B%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2222.828%22%20y%3D%22352.83%22%20fill%3D%22%23000%22%20font-size%3D%2214%22%20textLength%3D%22170.345%22%20font-weight%3D%22700%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%22%3ETr%C3%ACnh%20duy%E1%BB%87t%20kh%C3%B4ng%20tin%20c%E1%BA%ADy%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%21--cluster%20Ranh%20gi%E1%BB%9Bi%20%E1%BB%A9ng%20d%E1%BB%A5ng%20ph%C3%ADa%20m%C3%A1y%20ch%E1%BB%A7--%3E%3Cg%20class%3D%22cluster%22%20data-qualified-name%3D%22Ranh%20gi.i%20.ng%20d.ng%20ph.a%20m