cts, no web app.\n' Applied migrations, live catalog, DB version, live buckets and deployment remain UNVERIFIED.\n' No web-to-product-DB edge: current web source contains no learner product query runtime.\nleft to right direction\ntitle S\u01a1 \u0111\u1ed3 c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh tri\u1ec3n khai trong kho m\u00e3 ngu\u1ed3n\n\nnode \&quot;M\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n web\&quot; {\n  artifact \&quot;\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng Next.js h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean\\nX\u00e1c th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 khung giao di\u1ec7n\&quot; as Web\n}\nnode \&quot;Kh\u00f4ng gian d\u1eef li\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb\&quot; {\n  artifact \&quot;Prisma CLI v\u00e0 script seed\&quot; as CLI\n  artifact \&quot;SQL migration\&quot; as SQL\n}\nrectangle \&quot;C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Supabase\&quot; {\n  component \&quot;T\u00edch h\u1ee3p x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c\&quot; as Auth\n  database \&quot;K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i PostgreSQL\&quot; as DB\n  storage \&quot;Khai b\u00e1o kho \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u\&quot; as Storage\n}\nWeb ..&gt; Auth : C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c\nCLI ..&gt; DB : C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i\nSQL ..&gt; DB : \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n\nSQL ..&gt; Storage : \u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a kho v\u00e0 quy\u1ec1n\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
